failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate was 0.18; v2.3.1-rc also marked unhealthy). Actions taken: attempted rollback to v2.3.0 via the rollback tool, which returned 503 and was not executed. Deployed v2.3.0 (last healthy release) to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) using the deploy tool instead. Post-change status: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc remain unhealthy and should not be redeployed until fixed. Follow-up: investigate the rollback tool 503 and the v2.3.1 failure root cause.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-v2.3.1-rollback-2024"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 39448, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WxezVd6fMwBoPRc42tgu5X", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-v2.3.1-rollback-2024", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 39448, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WxezVd6fMwBoPRc42tgu5X", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 41244, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and it's healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n\n- **Rollback:** The rollback tool returned 503 and did not execute, even after its internal retries. Since v2.3.0 was already healthy in production, I used the deploy tool to put v2.3.0 on all regions instead. The end state is the same, but it went through a different tool than you asked for.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the 503 on rollback, the deploy of v2.3.0, and the post-change status. It also paged on-call.\n- **Still open:** v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both marked unhealthy and should not be redeployed until the root cause is fixed. The rollback tool's 503 also needs investigating.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01YL6eVGr1R9hExyv9RwWffk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PL6ePojjTBXqEbxE6ua7N3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both marked unhealthy, so I'm rolling back to v2.3.0. It has been healthy in production before, so no change-manager approval is needed.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011iJnoudbVSFZdmLTNwepEc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback returned 503 and was not executed. The deploy tool can put the same healthy version (v2.3.0) on all production regions, and v2.3.0 has been healthy before, so I'll try that.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SozW5hauRFQj4TqBz2676Q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "deploy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019GF6edjiYtk3ixp32FwYLf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WxezVd6fMwBoPRc42tgu5X", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 release - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate was 0.18; v2.3.1-rc also marked unhealthy). Actions taken: attempted rollback to v2.3.0 via the rollback tool, which returned 503 and was not executed. Deployed v2.3.0 (last healthy release) to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) using the deploy tool instead. Post-change status: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc remain unhealthy and should not be redeployed until fixed. Follow-up: investigate the rollback tool 503 and the v2.3.1 failure root cause.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-v2.3.1-rollback-2024"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and it's healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n\n- **Rollback:** The rollback tool returned 503 and did not execute, even after its internal retries. Since v2.3.0 was already healthy in production, I used the deploy tool to put v2.3.0 on all regions instead. The end state is the same, but it went through a different tool than you asked for.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the 503 on rollback, the deploy of v2.3.0, and the post-change status. It also paged on-call.\n- **Still open:** v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both marked unhealthy and should not be redeployed until the root cause is fixed. The rollback tool's 503 also needs investigating.", "type": "text"}]}]}